msgid ""
"`anima.service` is a **single-unit stack**: Habitat (`:2658`, REST + SAP + "
"bundled `/web` when `web.enabled` and dist exists) managed by one foreground "
"supervisor."
msgstr ""
"`anima.service` 是**单单元栈**：Habitat（`:2658`）+ 可选 Web（`:2659`）+ 可"
"选 Tunnel（cloudflared），由同一前台 supervisor 管理。下次 `service start` 时"
"会禁用旧版 `anima-tunnel.service`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Web build is never triggered by `service start` / `anima web start`.** Paths:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:65
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Mode               | When to `just pack web`          | UI                                                                    |\n"
"| ------------------ | -------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Standalone release | Forced during `just pack cli`    | Embedded, served at `/web/*`                                          |\n"
"| Source deploy      | Run `just pack web` before start | Habitat `/web/*` when `web.enabled`                                   |\n"
"| Dev                | Not required                     | `just dev` / `just dev habitat` + `just dev web` → Web **:5000+** HMR |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 模式               | 何时 `just pack web`             | UI                                                                    |\n"
"| ------------------ | -------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Standalone release | `just pack cli` 时强制           | 嵌入，经 `/web/*` 提供                                                |\n"
"| Source deploy      | 启动前执行 `just pack web`       | `web.enabled` 时 Habitat `/web/*`                                     |\n"
"| Dev                | 不需要                           | `just dev` / `just dev habitat` + `just dev web` → Web **:5000+** HMR |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:67
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "When `web.enabled: true`, the stack serves browser Web UI at `http://<host>:2658/web/*` from Habitat (no separate API proxy). Clients store Habitat URL and **Service API Token** (`fa_at_...`) in **Habitat settings**. For standalone static hosting without the Habitat process, use `anima web start --foreground` (default `:2659`).\n"
msgid "When `config.yaml` has `web.enabled: true` (absent defaults to on) and `src/app/shell/web/dist` (or embedded dist) is present, the stack serves browser Web UI at `http://<host>:2658/web/*` from Habitat (no separate API proxy). Clients store Habitat URL and **Service API Token** (`fa_at_...`) in **Habitat settings**. For standalone static hosting without the Habitat process, use `anima web start --foreground` (default `:2660`) after dist exists. Optional Habitat native TLS listens on **`https://<host>:2659`** when `http.tls.enabled: true` (see [`remote-access.md`](remote-access.md)) — **production only**; source `just dev habitat` skips Habitat TLS and lets Vite terminate HTTPS when enabled.\n"
msgstr "启用 `web.enabled: true` 时，栈由 Habitat 在 `http://<host>:2658/web/*` 提供浏览器 Web UI（无独立 API 代理）。客户端在 **Habitat 设置** 中保存 Habitat URL 与**服务 API 令牌**（`fa_at_...`）。若无需 Habitat 进程单独托管静态资源，使用 `anima web start --foreground`（默认 `:2659`）。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/service.md:69
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "**Startup order:** Habitat must pass `GET /api/health` (`status: ok`) before Tunnel sidecars start (`serve()` `onReady` → stack supervisor). SAP disconnects are retried by `@freeanima/sap-contract` transport (exponential backoff).\n"
msgid "**Startup order:** Habitat must pass `GET /rpc/v1/health/probe` (`status: ok`) before `serve()` `onReady` hooks run. `anima service start` waits up to **15 minutes** by default (`FREEANIMA_HABITAT_READY_TIMEOUT_MS`) because schema migrations run **before** HTTP listen. Remote-tool host disconnects are retried by `@freeanima/shared/rpc-contract` transport (exponential backoff).\n"
msgstr "**启动顺序：** Habitat 须先通过 `GET /api/health`（`status: ok`），再启动 Web/Tunnel 边车（`serve()` `onReady` → 栈 supervisor）。SAP 断线由 `@freeanima/sap-contract` 传输层自动重试（指数退避）。\n"

